<title>CHINA: NatWest sets warrants on basket of Hong Kong banks.</title>
<headline>NatWest sets warrants on basket of Hong Kong banks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Financial Products Plc said on Monday it has issued 669 million American-style call warrants on a basket of banking stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> HSBC Holdings Plc		 0.020 shares</p>
<p> Hang Seng Bank Ltd		0.032 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$8.4740    PREMIUM	  12.50 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.1561    GEARING	  5.7x</p>
<p> MATURITY	   21.MAY.98    PAYMENT DATE   05.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG    LISTING DATE   06.AUG.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   HK$8.92	BOARD LOT	10,000</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
